### Testes manuais das rotas
### Use com a extensão REST Client do VS Code
### ou copie para Insomnia, Postman ou Thunder Client.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Informações da API
GET {{base}}/

###############################################################
### TASKS
###############################################################

### Listar todas
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Listar só as concluídas
GET {{base}}/tasks?done=true

### Buscar uma
GET {{base}}/tasks/1

### Criar
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar NestJS",
  "description": "Controllers, services e módulos"
}

### Substituir inteira (PUT) — campos não enviados voltam ao padrão
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar NestJS (revisado)",
  "description": "Persistência em JSON",
  "done": false
}

### Alterar parcialmente (PATCH) — só o que for enviado muda
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Remover
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1

### Erro de validação (400) — falta o title
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "sem título"
}

###############################################################
### BOOKS
###############################################################

### Listar todos
GET {{base}}/books

### Filtrar por autor (busca parcial, sem diferenciar maiúsculas)
GET {{base}}/books?author=machado

### Buscar um
GET {{base}}/books/1

### Criar
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dom Casmurro",
  "author": "Machado de Assis",
  "year": 1899,
  "genre": "Romance"
}

### Substituir inteiro (PUT)
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas",
  "author": "Machado de Assis",
  "year": 1881,
  "genre": "Romance",
  "read": true
}

### Alterar parcialmente (PATCH)
PATCH {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "read": false
}

### Remover
DELETE {{base}}/books/1
